{"ID":"20240515131411-jr95fcz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131411-jr95fcz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131411-jr95fcz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140840-0wpcbl7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140840-0wpcbl7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140840-0wpcbl7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:214,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:214\u0026#125;","title":"063","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162817"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140840-0wpcbl7","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 665px;","id":"20240515140840-0wpcbl7","updated":"20240515162817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/1"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16歲，略矮，中等身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥之後仍無汗出，只有腋下及膝下出汗。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）大便一日2-3次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）服藥之後沒有心悸，無身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）身體肌肉已不酸痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）手涼額熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紅。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍有大青龍湯證。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃五錢 石膏一兩 杏仁五錢 炙甘草三錢桂枝四錢 生薑二片 大棗十枚  ×7帖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以大火6碗煮成2碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患服藥後仍無明顯汗出，手掌及足部膚色仍絳紅，倪師認為此乃皮下鬱熱仍在；而小腿皮膚毛細孔雖仍目視可得，但已不見污垢黑點，原有身體痛、肌肉酸痛的症狀也已痊癒。因此本診持續處方加重麻黃劑量，同樣加上等量杏仁避免傷及肺陰，桂枝劑量亦加重以助發汗排便已順暢，故將前方中大承氣湯去除。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}